{"text": "Old Behrman was a painter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who lived on the ground floor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Below them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was past sixty. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And had a long gray beard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For forty years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had painted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But he had never been successful. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was always about to paint. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A masterpiece but he had never yet begun it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He drank too much. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And laughed at softness. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In anyone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yet he thought of himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As a guard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To protect the two young artists upstairs. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Sue told him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> About Johnsys idea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He shouted angrily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At such foolishness. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A cold rain fell. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Mixed with snow. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a fierce wind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Blew all night long. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sue was sure. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That the last leaf would be gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By morning.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "l", "d", " ", "B", "e", "h", "r", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "p", "a", "i", "n", "t", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "f", "l", "o", "o", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "e", "l", "o", "w", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H"